			"notes": "This is an update to support submit in the Extension categories for Speedrunners!\n\n**WARNING! Old (<2.1) ghosts are no longer available.**\n\n## What's new?\n- **Now GhostRunner is required [SpeedRunIGT](https://github.com/RedLime/SpeedRunIGT) above 1.8.**\n- More support for extension categories.\n  - All Minerals / All Swords / All Workstations / Arbalistic / Enter End / Enter Nether / Full Iron Armor and 15 Levels / Full Inventory / Half% / How Did We Get Here? / Hero of the Village / High% / Kill Bosses\n  - More support categories will be added in future updates.\n- Added `GhostData#isGenerateStructures()` and `GhostData#getGhostCategory()`\n\n## What's changes?\n- Old ghosts are now moved to the mcg file with the path `%APPDATA%/.minecraft/ghostrunner/old_ghost`.\n- The submit screen now displays some information about the Ghost.\n- The Ghost list screen now displays the Ghost's category.\n\n## What's fixed problems?\n- Fixed F3 debug not being detected."
